WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.200
GOOD MORNING GAMERS!!

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.220
It's another beautiful day in Minecraft

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.840
and today is a very special day. Isn't that right, Sven?

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:08.540
*bark*

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:09.840
That's right.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.340
Hey Boat Cow, play the music.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.340
Okay, keep playing, Boat Cow.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:19.040
For many years, me and Sven have built together this structure,

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:28.340
a structure that symbolizes the power of friendship, the power of love, and the power of perseverance.

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.700
I introduce to you...

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.860
...the giant meatball.

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.420
*anime wow*

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.790
That's right.

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:40.100
Take it in, take it in in all it's glory

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.080
There is finally peace, on earth

00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.440
Isn't that right, chicken?

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:45.160
*Quack*

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:47.160
Water Sheep died for this, you know.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.220
He died to make this possible.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:52.300
Without water sheep, there would be no giant meatball.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:55.060
Why did I build a giant meatball you might ask?

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:56.800
For Water Sheep.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:00.980
This meatball represents everything that water sheep believed in:

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.720
Friendship,

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:04.180
loyalty,

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:05.740
trust,

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:10.060
and all those good things *laugh* that he stood by.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:12.960
What if Water Sheep was here alive today?

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:15.140
I know he would be proud.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:17.880
No one loved meatballs more than Water Sheep.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.740
He was like a father to me.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.320
He was like the son that I never had.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.460
And I loved him &lt;3.

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:26.240
I may have shown it in weird ways, Sven.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.620
I may have not always been the nicest.

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:32.120
And you know what, I'll admit, I may not have always been perfect.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.360
But my god

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:34.440
The meatball

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.800
Stands tall

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:38.540
And I'm so proud to call myself...

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:39.500
An American

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:40.760
*never mind* I don't even know...

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:43.700
Stop jumping in boats, Sven! Please!

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:46.660
I know you're excited, but I haven't even shown...

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:49.240
*sad* look at depressed cow over there.

00:01:49.240 --> 00:01:51.820
I haven't even shown you guys the best bit.

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.680
So I've been messing around with redstone.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:58.600
I've spent a lot of time with this Redstone and god I hope it works

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.920
Sorry Sven. You can't ride this; it might break.

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:04.140
You just gotta hit this, and then...

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.760
Voila baby.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:10.620
It's as glorious on the inside

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.840
as it is on the outside.

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:15.500
Italian leather exterior...

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:18.140
All handcrafted...

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:21.280
by one Scandinavian Swede.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:22.600
This took a lot of time!

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.860
I'm not gonna lie, I think the elevator

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:26.920
took more time for me to build.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:30.460
I thought: "okay cool, I'll build an elevator".

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:31.600
"That'll be epic".

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:32.660
Ummmm

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:34.300
Nah, it's not epic.

00:02:34.460 --> 00:02:36.240
I mean, it's super fun, like...

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:37.820
I love riding it...

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:38.780
I want it...

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:44.140
The idea was to have something go all the way, all the way to the top.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:46.140
The very top, and I'm like:

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:47.240
No.

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:47.820
*Laughs*

00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:50.740
I'm tired of farming piston steel material

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:54.580
I'm tired of the circuits always messing up and I don't understand why

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:56.580
But, It works pretty well.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.800
I'm like, it's really fun to ride it.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.000
The thing is, like...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.000
Sven! stop teleporting, you scare me

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:04.840
What if Sven rides it?

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.040
Oh my god, I never thought...

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.920
He's probably too short, I think he is too short, yeah

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:13.140
Sorry Sven, you're too short

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:14.040
Ha Ha

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:14.980
Let's try it

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:17.620
The thing is, I know you can build elevators..

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:20.500
Probably way smarter.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.140
I guarantee you that

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:24.400
I just wanted to try it out myself

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.460
I know I could probably do it easier as well if i had the… uh

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.140
The sticky pistons

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.140
I don't have sticky! I don't have slime!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.160
I don't have sticky

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:34.660
Ouch

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:36.100
I don't have sticky poo poo

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.100
Alright I'm not going near this place when it's dark

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.480
Too many creepers

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.120
Have blown up my circuits

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:42.420
Too many times...

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:45.540
For me to leave it around at dark

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:46.740
It ain't happening.

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.300
Alright, but let me show you.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.980
Seriously, I had so much fun building the elevator.

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.920
Like, I know it's janky and whatever.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:56.300
But I, I didn't realize redstone was so fun to just mess around with.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.920
Okay, so I want Sven to ride it.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.240
Sven! Come here.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:02.240
I want to see if it works. I'll be so happy.

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.100
Yeah sometimes, sometimes it breaks

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:06.780
Sometimes it breaks. It's fine.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:07.500
Sven, where are you?

00:04:07.500 --> 00:04:09.500
Helloooo?!

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:11.960
He's, like, stuck in the elevator.

00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:12.900
Sven?

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.620
Oh, there you are. Okay.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.060
Hey, can you come down here?

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.980
It's a ball inside of a ball.

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:19.320
What else do you want, baby?

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.320
Alright come on. Let's do this, Sven.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:23.540
Cool, inside the fence he teleports.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.700
Alright, follow me

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.700
I'm just gonna put the leash on you Sven

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.440
Because you're being a little difficult

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.260
Yeah this is going to be a problem

00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:34.880
Fine I'll make a special door for you Sven

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:37.340
Sven! You're being very difficult

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.340
Don't be shy

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.660
I'ts going to break the whole thing

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:40.820
SVEN! Please!

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:41.660
Please

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:42.680
Please

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:43.540
Go!

00:04:43.740 --> 00:04:44.850
Go

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:46.500
No, no! No!

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:48.800
I know you don't like tight spaces anymore after what happened

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.060
in '86 *machine gun fires*

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:50.820
Come on

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:52.440
Geebalibaa

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.440
Never have kids

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:56.840
Please, thank  you, thank you

00:04:57.100 --> 00:04:58.400
Sven is going to go for a ride

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.520
Listen I know you're scared of elevators..

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:01.960
It's fine! Trust me

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.060
Are you sitting? All right, here we go

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:04.560
Three

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:05.060
Two

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:05.560
One

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:08.820
*laughter*

00:05:09.380 --> 00:05:11.380
Wow! How was that Sven?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.860
Did you enjoy it?

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:14.980
Can you be quiet out here?

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:16.020
alright you can stand

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:17.920
So basically, the way it works..

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:18.940
It's a staircase.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.560
It's a glorified staircase

00:05:20.680 --> 00:05:22.960
One signal goes to the upper ones

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.960
One signal goes to the pusher ones

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.960
And they're one tick in delay

00:05:27.080 --> 00:05:28.200
And then...

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.140
...I don't know

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.120
It just took me a lot of time to figure out how redstone works

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.380
Isn't that right Sven?

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:35.160
*sigh* and a lot of wool

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.340
First I used stone, and i think the circuits would still connect

00:05:38.340 --> 00:05:39.700
And I didn't understand why

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.280
But then I saw other people use wool

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.680
So I'm like, okay I guess I'll use wool

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:45.760
And then these added delay, even if you dont add delay to them

00:05:45.760 --> 00:05:48.860
Which added another mystery to the problem

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.060
But basically, it goes

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:51.560
One

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.200
One, Two

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:52.860
One, Two, Three

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:53.740
One, Two, Three, Four *eep!*

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:54.620
SVEN!

00:05:54.620 --> 00:05:55.640
Where is he?

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:56.520
There you are.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.200
There you are. He's fine

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:57.980
Eat something

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:58.820
*Woof*

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.640
Uhh, wait what happened here

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:03.400
Does it double step here?

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:04.440
Is that even possible?

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:04.940
Is that even possible? Wait

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.660
Where's the next step?

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.400
It pushes here,

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:08.000
It pushes here, pushes here

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.100
It pushes here, pushes here, pushes here...

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.140
It pushes you up THERE!?

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:15.320
*laughs*

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.580
It still works apparently, okay cool

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.420
I didn't know that was possible

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:21.640
Let me try

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:22.260
What?

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.440
Oh my god, it skips a step

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:26.540
That's genius

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:28.300
I don't even know what I built

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.140
So yeah,

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:29.940
I, uh..

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:31.940
*elevator sounds*

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:34.180
It's so satisfying, I love the sound.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.320
That's why it gets stuck sometimes, my god!

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.290
I was planning to put carpet all around here

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.000
And maybe, like put a floor here.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.680
You could have a really big floor.

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:43.180
Right?

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:43.820
And then

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:44.960
I thought it could be cool maybe...

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:46.340
Can you do, like, catapults and stuff??

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:48.340
'Cause then, like, if I had Joergen here

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:51.040
and we head out on adventure, we could catapult out there into the water

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.520
These are just ideas I have

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.080
I want to build, Sven. I want to build.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.140
It's so fun to build.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:56.460
I LOVE MINECRAFT!

00:06:56.480 --> 00:06:58.260
Oh yeah, Joergen is gone, I forgot.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.480
*eternal sadness*

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.160
I lost Joergen.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.980
I have looked everywhere, Sven

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:04.880
Today...

00:07:04.880 --> 00:07:06.300
we bring back Joergen.

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.200
He has to be out somewhere.

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:08.880
He wouldn't just dis...

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:09.400
*moo*

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.400
Excuse me?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.060
Excuse me?! Water Cow?

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:14.680
You're good for one purpose, and one purpose only!

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:15.740
Actually 2

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.040
Playing music

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:20.040
And your delicious 'juice', thank you

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:21.880
Oh, that's right, we...

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.160
W-WHAT??

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:25.040
*Laughing*

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:30.740
Minecraft just keeps on surprising. I didn't know you could do this

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:32.720
Why can you do this?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.300
*moo*

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:35.740
♪ Me and Boat Cow ♪

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:37.340
♪ Forever and ever ♪

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:40.500
♪ Going on adventures and drinking his juice ♪

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:41.900
Damn, that was beautiful

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:43.900
Thanks, Boat Cow. You're the best.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:44.440
Okay.

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.880
I really miss Water Sheep. I'm not gonna lie.

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:48.360
I'm not over Water Sheep.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:50.200
I'm not over Joergen being lost.

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:51.880
I'm not over anything.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.100
I'm honestly hurt,

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:54.640
I'm confused,

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:58.080
and, you know, depression shows its way in many forms.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.280
And I chose to build a giant meatball.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.620
Other people do other things.

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:03.180
Okay?

00:08:03.720 --> 00:08:05.520
But now that meatball is built...

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:07.020
I still feel the pain.

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:08.700
It's still there.

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.980
Let me see if I can find something else.

00:08:10.980 --> 00:08:13.360
Like a substitute, right? I need to make this right.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:14.040
Hello there.

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:14.800
*Quack*

00:08:15.100 --> 00:08:16.100
Do you know water sheep?

00:08:16.100 --> 00:08:16.600
*Quack*

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:18.300
I'll tell you all about him

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:19.080
He was the best

00:08:19.080 --> 00:08:19.580
*quack*

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:20.640
"He was like a father to me?"

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.000
How did you know that?!

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:22.980
*laughs*

00:08:23.740 --> 00:08:25.000
Watch out for lava now

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:26.580
Don't want you to get hurt

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.160
*mutters* oh my god, idiot

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:32.260
Cool, you just ruined my life

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:34.320
Oh okay, never mind

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.760
You're the lucky new Water Sheep

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.240
It's an honor and a privilege

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.220
Where's the bell?

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.420
Here we go

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:47.800
Oh my god, the meatball appears before Ikea tower

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.920
*laughs*

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.440
My god, it's so beautiful

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:54.860
I was thinking of putting a Swedish flag on top

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.600
But I just got really tired of farming

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:59.180
It looks kinda like a deathstar or something

00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.060
Cool, I'm glad Sven is taken care of

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:01.840
Oh my god!

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:04.640
I knew you were evil, he's talking to spider!

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:06.100
Evil chicken!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:06.600
*quack*

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.880
My god!

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.740
How can you do this chicken??

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:11.300
*furious dinging*

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:11.940
Huh?!

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.380
Who am I kidding?

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.340
It's not the same, Sven.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.420
It's not the same.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:19.000
*continues dinging*

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:22.020
It doesn't feel as good as when Water Sheep did it..

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.400
You don't squeal in pain like Water Sheep.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:26.060
*chuckle*

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:27.840
IT'S NOT THE SAME!

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.080
*extreme dinging*

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:31.340
It will never be the same. What we had was special.

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:35.660
Alright, there's two Water Cows now because I'm too annoyed that Sven keeps entering.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.400
Oh, sorry Sven, Sorry!

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:39.680
What are you doing?!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.520
You get to live.

00:09:43.560 --> 00:09:48.500
Apparently you can build like a dispenser or something like that. I wanna try that.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:49.680
Wait, I think I have one.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:50.880
Oh yeah, it's right here.

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:53.260
See, I thought dispenser was...

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:54.140
like...

00:09:54.140 --> 00:09:56.140
A garbage bin or something.

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.300
Clearly not the case.

00:09:57.300 --> 00:09:58.780
Do I have a lever? Yeah

00:09:58.780 --> 00:09:59.920
Is this all I need?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.000
So if I place dispencer..

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:03.560
How does dispensers work?

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:04.380
There we go.

00:10:04.380 --> 00:10:06.580
And then I put like... so I can...

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.340
What are you doing?! How did you escape?

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:09.620
Don't look so innocent.

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:10.800
Oh gosh, you people are...

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:13.140
There you go, stay there.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:14.720
So do I just put a lever on it?

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:15.280
*pew*

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.000
Oh my god!

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:18.380
*chicken scream*

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.500
*laughter*

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.480
What?!

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:25.260
You'll never be water sheep!

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:26.780
Hey! Come on, come on.

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:27.660
Participate.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:28.200
*quack*

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.240
You'll never be Water Sheep!

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:30.740
*chicken scream*

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:31.720
WHAT?!

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:33.140
What?!

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.420
Sven, don't go near him!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:36.260
*quack*

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:37.320
He's evil.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:39.300
That's right, I see it in his eyes.

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.320
TELL ME WHERE WATER SHEEP IS!

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:44.620
Oh my god, how does he do that?!

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:46.180
Oh, what?

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:47.140
Aaaah!

00:10:47.140 --> 00:10:48.520
*chicken screams*

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:49.040
Stop!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:51.480
*more chicken screams*

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.540
You will never be Water Sheep!

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:54.320
*Empty clicking sound*

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:55.240
AaaAaah!!

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.320
WHY WON'T YOU DIE??!!!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.780
It just becomes more of them!

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:04.640
What?!

00:11:04.800 --> 00:11:07.080
Don't go there! Aaah, aaah...

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:08.220
You all went there.

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:09.940
Ugh, no...

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:12.680
Guys, this is a restricted area. You can't...

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:13.500
no...

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.360
Just get up from there, please.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:18.500
Well aren't you adorable?

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:19.200
Fine!

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.300
Alright, enough playing around.
We got actual stuff to do.

00:11:22.460 --> 00:11:23.860
*ominous ding*

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:25.360
It is 3 AM.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:27.680
*more ominous dinging*

00:11:27.680 --> 00:11:30.960
We are here to summon back Water Sheep.

00:11:31.100 --> 00:11:33.100
*even more dinging*

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:36.560
Minecraft spirits and gods! Notch, can you hear us?

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:39.260
*dinging continues*

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.120
We want Water Sheep back..

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:42.720
And Joergen too, of course!!

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:46.060
*ominous dinging continues*

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.940
I will ring this bell 3 times

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.000
We bring sacrifices!

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:55.920
On the third ring, I expect Water Sheep's return

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:57.260
One *ding*

00:11:58.300 --> 00:11:59.580
Two *ding*

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:00.080
*door sound*

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:01.660
*ding*

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:02.200
What the?!

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.220
Did you guys hear the door of the nether portal?!

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:05.740
Water Sheep?!

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:07.900
Water Sheep?!

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:10.880
You're not Water Sheep..

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.240
He's not coming back is he?

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:18.680
*cries*

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:19.320
Water Sheep...

00:12:19.560 --> 00:12:21.040
Stop it guys!

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.820
He'll never come back, Sven. I'm going to bed

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:28.660
And don't even try console me..

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:32.860
Okay, guys.

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:37.100
I think it's time we realized... Water Sheep is gone forever.

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:39.360
We need to build a memorial.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:40.720
It's the least thing I can do.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.000
This is for Water Sheep.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.560
Get out of the way! Can you not!?

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:46.440
There it is..

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:47.460
You know...

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:48.420
I may —

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:52.420
I may have been partially responsible for what happened to Water Sheep

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:53.820
I may have done...

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.720
I'm not perfect by any means

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.840
but I still loved him.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:57.700
That's right.

00:12:57.700 --> 00:13:00.860
We have gathered here today
to say goodbye to Water Sheep

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.200
NO! Stop – thank you

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.200
I'll continue, Sven... well that was it basically

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.220
Rest in peace Water Sheep, rest in peace

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:10.580
May your wool forever be soaked.. in water

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:12.560
*cries/laughs*

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.560
Okay, Sven

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:15.380
We may have lost Water Sheep

00:13:15.380 --> 00:13:18.040
But there's 2 people we can still retrieve, Sven

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:21.920
Joergen 2 and Bone Joergen are still out there

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:24.120
We're gonna get them, gosh darnit!

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:26.460
Now we need to make water drinking potion

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:28.620
And underwater seeing potion

00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.620
Poor pufferfish, I'm sorry!

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.620
It's to save Dinnerbone!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.800
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:36.380
Then

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:38.540
We have to make potion of night vision

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:39.980
so we can see.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.920
Golden Carrot, my god...

00:13:42.260 --> 00:13:43.440
...better be worth it.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.880
Let's extend it as well

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:47.460
It is done.

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:50.300
I'm bringing my lucky pufferfish on the way.

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:52.360
He'll guide the way to Dinnerbone.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.920
Come on Sven, hurry. Into the boat, Sven.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.300
There we go.

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:57.600
He's so cute~

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:00.920
We're gonna get them back Sven! Don't worry.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.960
Oh god, we're going near that place...

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:03.720
No!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:06.960
Don't worry. Sven, close your eyes.
Close your eyes; it's fine.

00:14:07.140 --> 00:14:09.140
Oh, look away. That's right, look away.

00:14:09.220 --> 00:14:11.080
Nothing bad over there.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.620
Woah, there's a shipwreck here. What kinda wood is this?

00:14:15.120 --> 00:14:16.480
Woah, I've never seen this!

00:14:17.260 --> 00:14:19.140
This is jungle? Jungle wood?

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.180
It's jungle! We've never been to jungle

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:23.980
Okay, but I have been here

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:25.300
Or someone else?

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:27.600
Probably Water Sheep. *spits*

00:14:28.060 --> 00:14:30.220
We have so many places left to explore in this game.

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:32.500
A THOUSAND-part series, Sven!

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:33.840
A thousand...

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:35.860
Perfect, it's getting dark. Great

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:36.580
Hah!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.520
So I think it was...

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:40.460
Yeah, Joergen was over there

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.720
and we swam from this island to here.

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.320
So it must have happened somewhere here in between.

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.980
Oh god, this is gonna be difficult. Okay...

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:51.240
Stay... stay and hold the boat, Sven?

00:14:51.460 --> 00:14:53.160
And I will look for, uh...

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.960
I will drink this.

00:14:57.020 --> 00:14:59.020
And this gives me underwater "drinking".

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.180
And this I need...

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:02.800
There it is... Woah!

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.800
I forget how awesome — woah, okay.
Now we actually have —

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.820
Woah, it's actually easier on...

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.960
Maybe I'll stay in the boat then.

00:15:10.000 --> 00:15:10.900
Okay, this is good.

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.320
Bone Joergen!

00:15:12.320 --> 00:15:13.720
He's white too, isn't he?

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:16.700
Bone Joergen, where are you? We miss you!

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:17.920
Bone Joergen!

00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:19.700
Are you out there?!?

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:22.600
Oh, I saw something white.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.500
Dude, I'm scanning.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:28.420
Guys, honestly I know this is Dora the Explorer,
but help me.

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:29.540
If you spot...

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.020
Did you guys see that? Or am I crazy?

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:35.700
If you spot em, you gotta tell a bro.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.700
I swear I saw something in between here

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:40.200
Frickin' eel things.

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:42.160
Right 'cause I went here, didn't I?

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:43.680
WHERE ARE YOU!?!

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:45.580
Dinnerbone!

00:15:45.780 --> 00:15:46.960
Helloooo!!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.040
I'm pulling up my coordinates

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:52.160
so you guys can tell me what coordinates, if you see him.

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:53.060
Hellooo!

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:54.320
It's impossible.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:57.260
I'm just going to scan over this area

00:15:57.440 --> 00:15:59.160
because this is where I lost him.

00:15:59.620 --> 00:16:00.340
No!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:01.500
*bark*

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:03.800
No! It's so dark.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.340
Mission failed, Sven.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.080
We'll get 'em next time.

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:15.760
Pufferfish, you did nothing!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.280
Explain yourself!

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:21.400
Oh god, come back, I was kidding! I was kidding! Oh god!

00:16:21.720 --> 00:16:22.740
Puffer I'm sorry!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.580
I'm sorry.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.440
You don't look too good, puffer.

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:30.040
Oh my GOD!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:33.540
Oh my god, JOERGEN!!

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.140
Joergen! Oh ho ho ho!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.120
I have wheat for you.

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:41.360
He doesn't want it

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.260
Where were you?!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.380
Where were you?!

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:48.100
Why are you here?!

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:50.300
You just wanted to walk?

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:52.260
Oh my god!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.240
How did you get here?!

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.040
I tried to find Dinnerbone, and I find real Joergen.

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:57.660
Epic.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:16:59.680
Oh my god, yes!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.020
The series is saved.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:04.180
The boys are back in town.

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:06.600
The boys are back in town! Gosh darnit!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.580
Why did you leave me? I was so scared.

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:10.200
*sigh*

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:11.880
Joergen #2!

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:15.140
I'm literally lost on the way back home.

00:17:15.240 --> 00:17:16.640
I swear I've been here before.

00:17:16.640 --> 00:17:18.640
Oh! Thank god, we made it back.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.960
My gosh, they're so beautiful!

00:17:22.120 --> 00:17:24.540
I'm teary-eyed, I'm so happy

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:29.680
Oh, We'll find Dinnerbone next time

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:33.780
Joergen, I have to show you the giant…
You haven't seen it complete!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:36.800
Oh my gosh, you disappeared while I was building it!

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.260
Oh, you stay there, please.

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:41.580
Alright Water Cow, play the song.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:42.520
*moo*

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.340
It's the song of Joergen and friendship.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:45.800
Listen to this, Joergen.

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.160
Damn, the base though.

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:47.960
Yeah!

00:17:48.220 --> 00:17:50.220
Joergen is back in town, baby!

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:52.180
That's what I'm talking about.

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:56.120
For those of you who don't know, we have new merch.

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:59.760
Check out represent.com/pewdiepie and support Joergen and Sven.

00:18:00.440 --> 00:18:02.720
We have Sven and Joergen merch, that's right Moo Cow.

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:04.220
Good luck next time.

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:05.860
Thanks for watching another episode!

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:08.820
Next time, we're gonna find the ender portal.

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:09.940
See you then.

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:10.840
Bye bye

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:11.560
WHAT?!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:14.120
You've never played Tuber Simulator?!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:15.640
Pfffffft

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.820
You know it's... fun, right?

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:20.540
I'm not supposed to give my opinion...

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:24.900
But give it a try,
and then you can tell me if it's good or not

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.000
Not convinced yet? Okay.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.900
I'll cut you a deal!

00:18:28.900 --> 00:18:31.000
The game is available for FREE.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:33.220
And that's a great price!

